other so-called ephemeral effects through search&nbsp;
and video suggestions, answer boxes, news feeds,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:54.720 --> 00:26:59.440
and more to target and manipulate voters&nbsp;in the real world on an ongoing basis.

00:26:59.440 --> 00:27:04.240
I haven't tried this, but what happens if we hit&nbsp;people with five effects at the same time?

